sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T1 as Thread 1: transfer BLR -> HYD
    participant T2 as Thread 2: transfer HYD -> BLR
    participant A as StockItem BLR/LAP-001
    participant B as StockItem HYD/LAP-001

    Note over T1,B: Both threads sort the two items by key ("BLR/..." < "HYD/...") and lock in that order
    T1->>A: lock()  (first)
    T2->>A: lock()  (first) -> waits
    T1->>B: lock()  (second)
    T1->>T1: check BLR qty, BLR -= n, HYD += n
    T1->>B: unlock()
    T1->>A: unlock()
    A-->>T2: acquired
    T2->>B: lock()
    T2->>T2: check HYD qty, HYD -= n, BLR += n
    T2->>B: unlock()
    T2->>A: unlock()
    Note over T1,B: Without ordering: T1 holds BLR waiting for HYD, T2 holds HYD waiting for BLR = deadlock
